Track 3: Stellar Descent Theory
- Story & Context: After the rescue, old Lena, one of the first trapped, spoke of the pipe-borne rhythms not as sound, but as an inverted astronomy – a way to map the heavens from below, translating the resonating echoes into cosmic trajectories, a myth born from confinement. "We saw the sky inside the earth, my loves, each beat a falling star.”
